{"name": "Marathon", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"374\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065800/extras/f003b08f1163d02125a3fd3bc7f05e4e.poster.avif?t=1786061300\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065800/extras/f003b08f1163d02125a3fd3bc7f05e4e.webm?t=1786061300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065800/extras/f003b08f1163d02125a3fd3bc7f05e4e.mp4?t=1786061300\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Infiltrate the dark sci-fi world of Marathon filled with rival players, enemy forces, and unpredictable dangers. Scavenge its maps alone or with a crew, then fight your way to extraction in tense, high-stakes PVP and PVE battles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SURVIVE AND THRIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"374\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065800/extras/0c1d2ddc1eb66f6834217df4145b61fa.poster.avif?t=1786061300\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065800/extras/0c1d2ddc1eb66f6834217df4145b61fa.webm?t=1786061300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065800/extras/0c1d2ddc1eb66f6834217df4145b61fa.mp4?t=1786061300\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scour dangerous locations for valuables, loot, and intel on the lost colony. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab gear off defeated players and enemies. Exfil successfully and fill your vault.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete contracts to earn rewards, upgrade your loadout, and come back stronger.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">YOUR STRATEGY, YOUR RUNNER </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"374\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065800/extras/66f103462965f068762163bc86cc1cd5.poster.avif?t=1786061300\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065800/extras/66f103462965f068762163bc86cc1cd5.webm?t=1786061300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065800/extras/66f103462965f068762163bc86cc1cd5.mp4?t=1786061300\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick a Runner shell that fits your playstyle, each with its own unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your loadout with an arsenal of moddable weapons and customizable abilities. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft countless builds, from stealthy infiltrators to frontline bruisers and support specialists.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">COUNT ON YOUR CREW, TRUST YOURSELF</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"374\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065800/extras/9055695cb8310550cfd15d60957fff7c.poster.avif?t=1786061300\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065800/extras/9055695cb8310550cfd15d60957fff7c.webm?t=1786061300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065800/extras/9055695cb8310550cfd15d60957fff7c.mp4?t=1786061300\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crew up in groups of two or three or take on Tau Ceti alone.   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Form cautious alliances balanced on a knife\u2019s edge. Make a deal with enemy players or betray their trust for your own gain. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as Rook, a lone scavenger with nothing to lose except what you find along the way.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PUSH AHEAD, GROW YOUR POWER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"374\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065800/extras/05a3bf7b813de51bb0acfbceca6ada19.poster.avif?t=1786061300\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065800/extras/05a3bf7b813de51bb0acfbceca6ada19.webm?t=1786061300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065800/extras/05a3bf7b813de51bb0acfbceca6ada19.mp4?t=1786061300\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow stronger throughout the course of the season and put your best loot on the line to earn incredible rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Climb the ladder and prove you\u2019re a top Runner in Ranked mode. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter Cryo Archive to crack raid-like challenges, solve layered puzzles, and clash with rival crews for top-tier loot.</p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "Explore the lost colony of Tau Ceti IV, scavenging valuable loot in a high-stakes survival first person shooter from the creators of Halo and Destiny.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065800/c3093fec19fed6eb0750a87261c53743a5757827/header.jpg?t=1786061300", "screenshots":